      "session_id": "e8af30b98889",
      "seq": 10,
      "start_s": 43.0,
      "end_s": 46.66,
      "en": "The roots transport water to the leaves through tubes called xylem.",
      "bn": "শিকড়টি নলকূপের মাধ্যমে পাতায় পানি পরিবহন করে।",
